            <ArticleTitle>[Clinical significance of hypercholesterolemia in the elderly].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>685-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hypercholesterolemia is known as a cardiovascular risk factor for the non elderly man. But it still remains the controversy about the significance of dislipidemia on the aged. The authors discuss the problem and suggest a therapeutic approach following the European Consensus Conference Guidelines.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
